    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "今天上课的时候，老师在同学面前说我是“淘气”的孩子。",
      "traditional": "今天上課的時候，老師在同學面前說我是“淘氣”的孩子。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shàng kè de shí hou lǎo shī zài tóng xué miàn qián shuō wǒ shì táo qì de hái zi",
      "english": "Little Ming: The teacher said so."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Today during class, the teacher said in front of the other students that I was “naughty’s” child."
    }
